@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Using tinycalc
+
+tinycalc reads one expression and prints its value.
+
+    expr   := term (("+" | "-") term)*
+    term   := factor (("*" | "/") factor)*
+    factor := NUMBER | "(" expr ")" | "-" factor
+
+Division is true division; `tinycalc "7 / 2"` prints `3.5`.
